    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n76382" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀψων-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>buy fish and other dainties</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀψωνεῖν ἔοιχ᾽ ἅνθρωπος ἐπὶ
					τυραννίδι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>V.</u>
					495
				</span></i>
			: c. acc., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τριχίδας ὀ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Eup.
				154
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καρκίνους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>V.</u>
					1506
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπογάστρια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antiph.
					192.1
				</span></i>
			, etc.: generally, <i>buy victuals, cater</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Mem.</u>
				3.14.1
			</span></i>: prov., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Δελφοῖσι θύσας αὐτὸς
				ὀψωνεῖ κρέας</span> ap.<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.709a
			</span></i>.</div>
